{
  "duration": 54.239,
  "phrases": [
    {
      "start": 0.099,
      "end": 1.539,
      "text": "So welcome back again."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.039,
      "end": 3.439,
      "text": "Time for one more problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.839,
      "end": 4.599,
      "text": "Now, in this problem,"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.019,
      "end": 6.559,
      "text": "we are given that a boat"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.039,
      "end": 9.559,
      "text": "covers forty-two kilometer upstream"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.039,
      "end": 13.659,
      "text": "at a speed of fourteen kilometer per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.279,
      "end": 17.619,
      "text": "The question is asking us to find the time required for the journey."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.18,
      "end": 18.639,
      "text": "Now, first,"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.139,
      "end": 20.819,
      "text": "let us note down the given values."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.479,
      "end": 24.799,
      "text": "Distance traveled upstream is forty-two kilometer."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.42,
      "end": 29.799,
      "text": "Upstream speed of the boat is fourteen kilometer per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.26,
      "end": 31.599,
      "text": "Now, we know the basic formula,"
    },
    {
      "start": 32.139,
      "end": 35.599,
      "text": "time is equal to distance divided by speed."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.219,
      "end": 37.199,
      "text": "Putting the values,"
    },
    {
      "start": 37.68,
      "end": 41.0,
      "text": "time is equal to forty-two divided by fourteen."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.7,
      "end": 44.119,
      "text": "After simplifying this, we get three hours."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.599,
      "end": 50.399,
      "text": "So the boat takes three hours to travel forty-two kilometer upstream."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.919,
      "end": 51.299,
      "text": "Hence,"
    },
    {
      "start": 51.759,
      "end": 54.239,
      "text": "the correct answer is option D."
    }
  ],
